#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:9
msgid "Coding Standards"
msgstr "代码规范"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:11
msgid "Nexus follows strict coding standards for quality and safety."
msgstr "Nexus 遵循严格的代码规范，以保障质量与安全。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:13
msgid "C Standard"
msgstr "C 语言标准"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:15
msgid "C11 for source code"
msgstr "源码采用 C11"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:16
msgid "C11 for production code and maintained C contract fixtures"
msgstr "生产代码及维护范围内的 C 合同夹具采用 C11"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:17
msgid ""
"C++17 for host GoogleTest/GoogleMock and external ABI consumer checks; "
"neither the test framework nor its C++ runtime enters firmware"
msgstr "主机 GoogleTest/GoogleMock 及外部 ABI 消费验证采用 C++17；测试框架和其 C++ 运行时均不进入固件"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:20
msgid "Code Formatting"
msgstr "代码格式"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:22
msgid ""
"The project uses clang-format for automatic code formatting. Run `clang-"
"format` before committing code."
msgstr "项目使用 clang-format 自动格式化代码。提交代码前运行 `clang-format`。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:25
msgid "Indentation"
msgstr "缩进"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:27
msgid "Use 4 spaces for indentation (no tabs)"
msgstr "使用 4 个空格缩进，不使用制表符"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:28
msgid "Indent case labels inside switch statements"
msgstr "switch 语句中的 case 标签需要缩进"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:29
msgid "Do not indent preprocessor directives"
msgstr "预处理指令不缩进"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:31
msgid "Line Length"
msgstr "行长度"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:33
msgid "Maximum line length: 80 characters"
msgstr "每行最长 80 个字符"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:34
msgid "Break long lines at appropriate points"
msgstr "在适当位置拆分长行"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:36
msgid "Braces"
msgstr "花括号"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:38
msgid "Use attached braces (K&R style):"
msgstr "使用同行左花括号（K&R 风格）："

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:52
msgid "Spaces"
msgstr "空格"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:54
msgid "Space after control keywords: `if (`, `for (`, `while (`"
msgstr "控制关键字后加空格：`if (`、`for (`、`while (`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:55
msgid "No space after function names: `func()`"
msgstr "函数名后不加空格：`func()`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:56
msgid "No space after casts: `(int)value`"
msgstr "类型转换后不加空格：`(int)value`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:57
msgid "Two spaces before trailing comments"
msgstr "行尾注释之前保留两个空格"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:58
msgid "Space around binary operators: `a + b`, `x = y`"
msgstr "二元运算符两侧加空格：`a + b`、`x = y`"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:60
msgid "Pointer Alignment"
msgstr "指针对齐"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:62
msgid "Pointers align to the left (with the type):"
msgstr "指针星号左对齐，与类型放在一起："

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:69
msgid "Empty Lines"
msgstr "空行"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:71
msgid "Maximum one consecutive empty line"
msgstr "最多保留一个连续空行"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:72
msgid "Use empty lines to separate logical sections"
msgstr "使用空行分隔逻辑段落"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:74
msgid "Naming Conventions"
msgstr "命名约定"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:76
msgid "Functions: `module_action_object()` (e.g., `nx_gpio_port_write()`)"
msgstr "函数：`module_action_object()`（例如 `nx_gpio_port_write()`）"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:77
msgid "Types: `module_type_t` (e.g., `nx_result_t`)"
msgstr "类型：`module_type_t`（例如 `nx_result_t`）"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:78
msgid "Macros: `MODULE_MACRO_NAME` (e.g., `NX_SUCCESS`)"
msgstr "宏：`MODULE_MACRO_NAME`（例如 `NX_SUCCESS`）"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:79
msgid "Constants: `MODULE_CONSTANT` (e.g., `NEXUS_UART0_SELECTED`)"
msgstr "常量：`MODULE_CONSTANT`（例如 `NEXUS_UART0_SELECTED`）"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:80
msgid "Static variables: `s_variable_name` prefix"
msgstr "静态变量：使用 `s_variable_name` 前缀"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:81
msgid "Global variables: `g_variable_name` prefix (avoid when possible)"
msgstr "全局变量：使用 `g_variable_name` 前缀（尽量避免）"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:83
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "文档注释"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:85
msgid ""
"All public APIs must have Doxygen comments. This project uses `\\\\` style "
"Doxygen tags (not `@` style)."
msgstr "所有公共 API 必须有 Doxygen 注释。本项目采用 `\\\\` 风格的 Doxygen 标签，不使用 `@` 风格。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:88
msgid "Tag Alignment"
msgstr "标签对齐"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:90
msgid ""
"Align the description after each Doxygen tag as shown below. Excluding any "
"surrounding code indentation, the description starts at column 21: the tag "
"and its padding occupy 17 characters after the opening comment star:"
msgstr ""
"按下面的示例对齐每个 Doxygen 标签后的说明。不计外围代码缩进，说明从第 21 列开始：注释起始星号后的标签及补齐空格共占 17 个字符："

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:103
msgid "File Header Format"
msgstr "文件头格式"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:105
msgid "Every source file must have a file header comment."
msgstr "每个源文件必须包含文件头注释。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:107
msgid "**Header files (.h)** - Minimal format:"
msgstr "**头文件（.h）**——最简格式："

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:117
msgid "**Source files (.c)** - Full format with version and copyright:"
msgstr "**源文件（.c）**——包含版本和版权的完整格式："

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:134
msgid "Header Files (.h)"
msgstr "头文件 (.h)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:136
msgid ""
"Header files contain full API documentation including parameters and return "
"values:"
msgstr "头文件提供完整 API 文档，包括参数和返回值："

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:148
msgid "Source Files (.c)"
msgstr "源文件 (.c)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:150
msgid ""
"Source definitions explain hardware ordering and invariants without "
"duplicating `\\param` or `\\return` from the header. Use `\\brief`, "
"`\\details` and ``\\note`` as needed:"
msgstr ""
"源文件定义解释硬件操作顺序和不变量，不重复头文件的 `\\param` 或 `\\return`。按需使用 `\\brief`、`\\details` "
"和 ``\\note``："

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:161
msgid "Section Comments"
msgstr "章节注释"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:163
msgid ""
"Use section comments to organize code into logical blocks. The separator "
"line must be exactly 79 characters (`/*` + 75 characters + `*/`), preserving"
" the existing template:"
msgstr "使用分区注释将代码组织为逻辑块。分隔行必须恰好为 79 个字符（`/*` + 75 个字符 + `*/`），保持既有模板："

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:173
msgid ""
"**Important**: Do NOT use `/*===...===*/` style separators. Always use "
"`/*---...---*/` for consistency."
msgstr "**重要**：禁止使用 `/*===...===*/` 风格的分隔符。统一使用 `/*---...---*/`。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:176
msgid "CMake Section Comments"
msgstr "CMake 章节注释"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:178
msgid ""
"CMake section separator lines must be exactly 77 characters: `#` followed by"
" 76 hyphens or spaces. This rule is independent of the 79-character C/C++ "
"section comments above."
msgstr "CMake 分隔行必须恰好为 77 个字符：`#` 后跟 76 个连字符或空格。此规则独立于上述 79 字符的 C/C++ 分区注释。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:182
msgid ""
"Use the following template only for substantial top-level sections; short "
"files and function bodies normally need blank lines and concise "
"responsibility comments:"
msgstr "以下模板仅用于内容较多的顶层分区；短文件和函数体通常只需空行及简短的职责注释："

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:191
msgid ""
"Use four-space indentation and an 80-column target. Keep short calls on one "
"line and group long argument lists by responsibility. Quote paths while "
"preserving intentional list expansion, generator expressions and static-"
"library link order. Declare `PUBLIC`, `PRIVATE` and `INTERFACE` dependencies"
" explicitly; vendor headers and implementation definitions remain private. "
"Use the locked formatter for owned CMake files, never for vendor sources. "
"Commit checks report differences without rewriting or staging files."
msgstr ""
"使用四空格缩进，以 80 列为目标。短调用保持单行，长参数列表按职责分组。路径加引号，同时保留有意使用的列表展开、生成器表达式和静态库链接顺序。显式声明"
" `PUBLIC`、`PRIVATE` 和 `INTERFACE` 依赖；厂商头文件及实现定义保持私有。仅对本项目维护的 CMake "
"文件使用锁定版本的格式化工具，不处理厂商源码。提交检查只报告差异，不重写或暂存文件。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:199
msgid "Inline Comments"
msgstr "行内注释"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:201
msgid "Use ``/* comment */`` style for inline comments, not ``//``:"
msgstr "行内注释采用 ``/* comment */``，不使用 ``//``："

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:207
msgid "Macro Comments"
msgstr "宏注释"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:209
msgid "Use Doxygen block comments or inline comments for macros:"
msgstr "宏使用 Doxygen 块注释或行内注释："

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:221
msgid "Static Functions"
msgstr "静态函数"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:223
msgid "Static functions use simplified comments with only ``\\brief``:"
msgstr "静态函数使用仅含 ``\\brief`` 的简化注释："

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:234
msgid "Prohibited Practices"
msgstr "禁止事项"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:236
msgid "The following practices are NOT allowed:"
msgstr "禁止以下做法："

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:238
msgid "Using `@` style Doxygen tags (use `\\\\` instead)"
msgstr "使用 `@` 风格的 Doxygen 标签（应改用 `\\\\`）"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:239
msgid "Using `//` single-line comments (use `/* */` instead)"
msgstr "使用 `//` 单行注释（应改用 `/* */`）"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:240
msgid "Using `/*===...===*/` section separators (use `/*---...---*/` instead)"
msgstr "使用 `/*===...===*/` 分区分隔符（应改用 `/*---...---*/`）"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:241
msgid "Duplicating `\\param` and `\\return` in source files (only in headers)"
msgstr "在源文件重复 `\\param` 和 `\\return`（仅在头文件提供）"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:243
msgid "Ownership and evidence"
msgstr "所有权与证据"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:245
msgid ""
"Public declarations specify context, deadlines, retained storage and failure"
" state. Describe why a volatile read, ordering barrier or drain is "
"necessary. `SETTLED` is the provider's final request access. Cancellation "
"never permits reclaiming a borrowed buffer before settlement or proved "
"controlled recovery."
msgstr ""
"公共声明须说明执行上下文、截止时间、保留存储和失败后的状态。解释为何需要 volatile 读取、顺序屏障或排空。`SETTLED` 表示 "
"provider 最后一次访问该请求。借用缓冲区只有在请求结清或已证明受控恢复后才可回收，取消本身不授予回收权限。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:250
msgid ""
"Changed files pass whole-file formatting and mechanical comment checks. "
"Install local Git hooks with `python scripts/setup/install_dev_tools.py`. "
"The commit and CI gates share `scripts/ci/style_gate.py`; no hook bypass is "
"a validation result. Actual warning/analyzer and behavioral evidence is "
"separate from style."
msgstr ""
"修改的文件须通过整文件格式化及机械注释检查。使用 `python scripts/setup/install_dev_tools.py` 安装本地 "
"Git hooks。提交和 CI 门禁共用 `scripts/ci/style_gate.py`；绕过 hook "
"不构成验证结果。实际编译警告、分析器和行为证据与风格检查分别记录。"

#: ../../../../../../docs/development/coding-standards.md:255
msgid ""
"Selected analyzer checks do not establish MISRA certification or industrial "
"functional-safety qualification."
msgstr "选定分析器检查不建立 MISRA 认证或工业功能安全资格。"
